ciled `Bovine_Serum_Albumin.yaml` candidate SHA256 `d9c58b2297f6aef28850dac72e708f3a0df3eac949693ba8d2edd1c1de26f9bc` preserves a new W05 note at `supplied_form[5].notes`: “manufacturer/catalog and final ADC/OADC volume not established.” This entry's case70, `CM_NAME:8ba1df295abb60b7fb8cd7e12f80b861e3d2e7634dd64e3bfb7e88df0db0fd08`, is [TOGO M194 / JCM201 BSK medium](https://togomedium.org/medium/M194), not ADC/OADC.\n\nThe complete source capture SHA256 `84717c209dda5e9fc18a4ee5b1456ee655f243d31013b41b0d118ff17d03bdb9` explicitly lists Bovine albumin, Fraction V,50g. It has mixed volume-bearing ingredients and final rabbit-serum supplementation, without a justified exact final volume for a protein-concentration calculation. Replace only the irrelevant ADC/OADC context with truthful BSK context and the unresolved final preparation volume. Preserve literal Fraction V, unknown supplier/catalogue,50g source amount, recipe membership and source history. Do not convert this amount to50g/L.\n\nThis is distinct from #1222's JCM220/MediaDive3888 occurrence quantity. Preserve its independently reviewed WITHHOLD correction and all other full-companion claims. The BSK wording repair neither re-approves that quantity nor establishes inherited A7030 processing/purity claims. Record the narrow correction in a new immutable reconciled candidate and obtain independent review; no owner, role or release approval is granted here.\n\n<!-- mim-fingerprints:bsa-case70-bsk-context-note -->\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/comments/6718748704/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"pin":null}